WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.920
Spark is not always the right tool A conventional
database may be better

00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:11.749
for transactional workloads frequent small updates
low-latency point lookups and strict relational

00:00:11.762 --> 00:00:17.565
constraints If the data fits comfortably in the
database and the query workload

00:00:17.578 --> 00:00:21.986
is already efficient moving to Spark may add
complexity without much benefit
